{%- comment -%}
Person entity for search engines. The theme emits a WebSite object with an
author name and nothing else, which does not tell Google that this page, the
ORCID record, the Scholar profile and the LinkedIn account are one researcher,
and carries no Korean form of the name. alternateName covers the spellings a
search can arrive on: the passport spelling, the author spelling, and 유영진.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
